## Quick CLI helpers

```bash
# Search across this vault
wiki-search "<query>" --vaults ${vault_id}

# Open contradictions (course-local + root, per-project layout)
grep -rn "## Contradictions" Lessons/*/_concepts Lessons/*/_entities \
        _concepts _entities 2>/dev/null

# Last 5 journal entries
ls -t 00-Vault-Index/log/*.md | head -1 | xargs grep "^## \[" | tail -5

# Cross-course duplicates (potential promotion candidates)
find Lessons -mindepth 3 -path "*/_concepts/*.md" -printf "%f\n" 2>/dev/null \
        | sort | uniq -d
```

